{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udd7f\ufe0f <strong>Parking Tycoon 2: Business Simulator</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to the world of parking business! In <i>Parking Tycoon 2: Business Simulator</i>, you're not only building and expanding your empire \u2014 you're personally defending it from thieves. A brand-new combat system, skill progression, and hireable guards turn your parking lot into a true fortress!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade Your Management Skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the owner of a parking business, you'll once again start with an empty plot of land \u2014 but now with even more tools to turn it into a thriving empire. Build new lots, upgrade equipment, install surveillance systems, and manage your staff \u2014 from cashiers to professional security guards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your own strategy: maximize profits, expand your territory, ensure customer safety, and dominate the industry. Investments, layout, technology \u2014 you're in full control.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Business Under Threat? Defend It Yourself</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The key innovation in <i>Parking Tycoon 2: Business Simulator</i> is its active combat system. You can now confront thieves head-on as they attempt to raid your property. Use punches, blocks, and dodges, apply tactics, and develop your character\u2019s combat skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire guards, each with unique stats and abilities. Level them up, build your team, and make sure no criminal walks away unpunished. Security is no longer just for show \u2014 it\u2019s a crucial part of your gameplay strategy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deep Management &amp; Mystery</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Running a parking lot involves more than lines and payments. Deal with breakdowns, unstable weather, and sometimes even unexplained events. The land you\u2019re building on still holds secrets. Explore it, unlock new zones, and discover why you were the one chosen to bring order.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Become a Parking Legend</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep customer satisfaction high, optimize pricing, manage traffic flow, and build your reputation. The mix of business simulation, resource management, and action creates a unique experience where every detail matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udd7f\ufe0f Build. Manage. Defend. Welcome to <i>Parking Tycoon 2: Business Simulator</i>.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3743410?t=1774277610","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743410/9d5f48dd3a4684cfc1b293cf4305d8bb9143a194/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774277610","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743410/b8fdc7f07d8aba2b5dc1d77afbe88653eaf337a8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774277610","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743410/b8fdc7f07d8aba2b5dc1d77afbe88653eaf337a8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774277610","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udd7f\ufe0f <strong>Parking Tycoon 2: Business Simulator</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to the world of parking business! In <i>Parking Tycoon 2: Business Simulator</i>, you're not only building and expanding your empire \u2014 you're personally defending it from thieves. A brand-new combat system, skill progression, and hireable guards turn your parking lot into a true fortress!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade Your Management Skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the owner of a parking business, you'll once again start with an empty plot of land \u2014 but now with even more tools to turn it into a thriving empire. Build new lots, upgrade equipment, install surveillance systems, and manage your staff \u2014 from cashiers to professional security guards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your own strategy: maximize profits, expand your territory, ensure customer safety, and dominate the industry. Investments, layout, technology \u2014 you're in full control.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Business Under Threat? Defend It Yourself</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The key innovation in <i>Parking Tycoon 2: Business Simulator</i> is its active combat system. You can now confront thieves head-on as they attempt to raid your property. Use punches, blocks, and dodges, apply tactics, and develop your character\u2019s combat skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire guards, each with unique stats and abilities. Level them up, build your team, and make sure no criminal walks away unpunished. Security is no longer just for show \u2014 it\u2019s a crucial part of your gameplay strategy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deep Management &amp; Mystery</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Running a parking lot involves more than lines and payments. Deal with breakdowns, unstable weather, and sometimes even unexplained events. The land you\u2019re building on still holds secrets. Explore it, unlock new zones, and discover why you were the one chosen to bring order.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Become a Parking Legend</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep customer satisfaction high, optimize pricing, manage traffic flow, and build your reputation. The mix of business simulation, resource management, and action creates a unique experience where every detail matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udd7f\ufe0f Build. Manage. Defend. Welcome to <i>Parking Tycoon 2: Business Simulator</i>.</p>","developers":["Geekon"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743410/e5b3b2f3cc9b7c17017659dc0efc3b303ee520a4/heade